   "title": "Young woman + ovarian mass: send SERUM MARKERS",
   "lines": [
    "alpha-fetoprotein (α-FP) · lactate dehydrogenase (LDH) · beta-hCG (β-hCG)",
    "they aid the diagnosis AND post-op monitoring"
   ]
  },
